Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: New file, a text viewer and editor, and a text share
 target

- Overflow: New file (next to New folder; "New file.txt", name part selected; a text file
  opens straight in the editor); no New window (browsing tabs do that job)
- Text viewer and editor (PlaitTextActivity, Compose, Plait top bar): selectable monospace
  viewer; editor that focuses with the keyboard, Save in place (documents that support
  writing), Save as, unsaved-changes prompt, Share, Open with; UTF-8, files over 2 MB refused
- Open with sheet: Text viewer and Text editor first under Built into Files for text files
- Registered for VIEW / EDIT of text (text/*, JSON, XML, shell, YAML) and as a share target
  for text: shared text opens unsaved in the editor for Save as

Checked on the phone: menu, New file, typing and Save, Open with > Text viewer, shared text.

